                <pb facs="0153" n="65" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg65"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr.
                            Egan.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-07-19"><hi rendition="#italic">July 19,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Egan is congratulated on the settlement of indemnity for the assault upon the
                    sailors of the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Baltimore</hi>, and is
                    authorized to negotiate a convention for the settlement of claims against
                    Chile.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
